[[stairs]]:
You climb the spiral stairs to the lamp room. The great lamp is dark.

{{#if has_matches}}
[[Light the lamp]].
{{else}}
You have nothing to light it with. Perhaps the [[keeper's room]] has something.
{{/if}}

[[Light the lamp]]:
The lamp flares into life, and its beam sweeps out across the water. Somewhere out there, a ship turns towards safety.

**The End**
